{"meetingId": "621", "tickets": [
{"title": "Complete household profile update", "text": "Refresh the household profile using client-provided updates and recent planning notes for Rowan Lanternmoss. Confirm household members, contact preferences, employment status, dependents, trusted contacts, insurance context, estate document status, and any major life changes that may affect planning recommendations. Rowan asked the team to update the planning record to show Elia Lanternmoss as a dependent, add Jules Lanternmoss's updated Cloudberry Kite School Services employer benefits information, and reflect revised monthly spending of about $10,800 after infant care costs were added.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2026-02-03", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "b9bbc98a-1f36-58b9-822a-d05a22356a28", "subTasks": [
{"title": "Collect profile change information", "text": "Request or compile updates for household members, addresses, contact preferences, employment, dependents, and major recent or expected life events. Include Elia Lanternmoss as a dependent, Jules's updated employer benefits, and revised monthly spending of about $10,800.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "1616b784-b182-570a-93f0-464e57273315", "dueDate": null},
{"title": "Update planning assumptions", "text": "Revise income, savings, spending, retirement timing, education funding, and family support assumptions in the planning record as applicable. Reflect the revised monthly spending of about $10,800 after infant care, formula, and medical copays.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "4c50b52d-b095-5034-aa4e-727cb24fa800", "dueDate": null},
{"title": "Identify advice impacts", "text": "Flag changes that may affect tax planning, risk management, estate coordination, cash flow, or investment allocation recommendations, including the adoption of Elia Lanternmoss finalized 2026-01-09.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "77bba01f-a9ba-5af1-8070-be336e499218", "dueDate": null},
{"title": "Confirm profile completion", "text": "Review the updated profile for consistency and note any remaining open questions for the next client conversation.", "priority": "low", "assigneeId": "29e3bddf-1fa1-5d47-a1a5-65045f866fc7", "dueDate": null}
], "evidence": "For the household profile refresh, Rowan asked the advisory team to update the planning record to show Elia as a dependent, add Jules’s updated employer benefits information, and reflect the revised monthly spending after infant care costs were added. The agreed follow-up is due 2026-02-03."},
{"title": "Prepare estate attorney planning note", "text": "Prepare a planning note for Rowan Lanternmoss's estate attorney covering the adoption of Elia Lanternmoss, the preferred guardian discussion, successor trustee considerations, and account ownership information needed before the attorney revises the 2020 will and revocable trust. Note that the 2020 documents name Casey Lanternmoss as first successor trustee and do not list a guardian for a minor child.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-02-10", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Rowan requested a planning note for the estate attorney covering the adoption, preferred guardian discussion, successor trustee considerations, and account ownership information needed before the attorney revises the will and trust. The agreed follow-up is due 2026-02-10."},
{"title": "Model life insurance coverage needs", "text": "Model survivor income, mortgage payoff, childcare, and education assumptions for both Rowan Lanternmoss and Jules Lanternmoss, since existing life insurance amounts were set before Elia joined the household. Rowan has a $750,000 employer group life policy and a $500,000 Silver Marmot Insurance term policy; Jules has $300,000 of employer group life and no individual term policy.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-02-12", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to model survivor income, mortgage payoff, childcare, and education assumptions for both Rowan and Jules, due 2026-02-12."},
{"title": "Follow up on policy renewal details", "text": "Contact the client or insurance professional to confirm renewal status, premium change, coverage changes, beneficiary updates needed, and any action required before the renewal window closes. Record received documents and route planning questions to the advisor. For Rowan Lanternmoss's Silver Marmot Insurance term policy renewal, obtain the current premium, conversion language, beneficiary page, and any renewal action requirements before Rowan responds.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2026-02-06", "assigneeId": "1616b784-b182-570a-93f0-464e57273315", "templateId": "daf3067e-a97c-53bc-b265-e4d0b6ab86f2", "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to obtain the current premium, conversion language, beneficiary page, and any renewal action requirements before Rowan responds, due 2026-02-06."},
{"title": "Collect Elia's adoption and identification documents", "text": "Obtain Elia Lanternmoss's final adoption decree, birth certificate, and Social Security number confirmation for the secure records folder, since these are needed to support account beneficiary updates and education account paperwork. The adoption was finalized 2026-01-09 and Elia was born 2025-10-14.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-02-05", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Evan identified that the secure records folder does not yet contain Elia’s final adoption decree, birth certificate, or Social Security number confirmation, which are needed to support account beneficiary updates and education account paperwork. The agreed follow-up is due 2026-02-05."},
{"title": "Resolve beneficiary designation discrepancy", "text": "Resolve the beneficiary discrepancy on Rowan Lanternmoss's individual term life policy issued by Silver Marmot Insurance: the beneficiary export shows Casey Lanternmoss as primary beneficiary, while Rowan said Jules Lanternmoss should be primary and Elia Lanternmoss should be included under the updated estate plan structure.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-02-09", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "The beneficiary export reviewed in the meeting showed Rowan’s old individual term policy naming Casey Lanternmoss as primary beneficiary, while Rowan said Jules should be primary and Elia should be included under the updated estate plan structure. The agreed follow-up is due 2026-02-09."},
{"title": "Compare education funding account options", "text": "Compare ownership, contribution, and investment options for opening an education funding account for Elia Lanternmoss, including whether grandparents can contribute directly without changing the household's cash reserve target of at least six months of core expenses in cash while Elia is under age five.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-02-17", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Rowan asked for a comparison of ownership, contribution, and investment options for opening an education funding account for Elia, including whether grandparents can contribute directly without changing the household’s cash reserve target. The agreed follow-up is due 2026-02-17."},
{"title": "Troubleshoot portal document upload issue", "text": "Troubleshoot the client portal issue that rejected Rowan Lanternmoss's PDF of the adoption decree twice, or provide an alternate secure delivery method for the document.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-01-27", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "Rowan reported that the portal rejected a PDF of the adoption decree twice. The agreed follow-up is to troubleshoot the upload issue or provide an alternate secure delivery method, due 2026-01-27."}
]}
